    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;be the solution of the differential&nbsp;equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,&nbsp;with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. Then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is equal to"
